# GitHub Copilot Adapter

This project follows Agentic Project Governance (APG).

Canonical project governance lives in:

- `GOVERNANCE.md`
- `.governance/manifest.yaml`
- `.governance/policies/`
- applicable scoped instruction files

Project facts are resolved from authoritative sources declared in the APG manifest.

Do not assume `PROJECT.md` is mandatory.

Do not treat this adapter as an independent policy source.
